  "renderedMainHtml": "\n    <div class=\"news-meta-line\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px; padding-bottom:12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color, #E5E7EB);\">\n      <span class=\"news-category-tag\">Security Advisory</span>\n      <span>Published: <strong>October 28, 2026</strong></span>\n      <span>· By <strong>Security &amp; Compliance Desk</strong></span>\n      <span>· 2 min read</span>\n    </div>\n    \n    <p>Transparency and verifiable user safety are core to the <strong>ApexMobile</strong> release process. Every build undergoes automated and manual binary inspection before publication.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"audit-summary\">Audit Summary</h3>\n<p>All release packages were tested against 72 independent security scanners with zero flags. Additionally, reproducible build verification confirms that the downloadable binary matches our source tree bit-for-bit.</p>\n    \n    \n        <div class=\"internal-crawl-hub\" style=\"margin-top:24px; padding:14px 16px; border:1px solid var(--border-color, #E2E8F0); border-radius:10px; background:var(--bg-page, #F8FAFC);\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em; color:#64748B; margin-bottom:8px;\">Official Portal Guides &amp; Resources</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px;\">\n            <a href=\"/\" data-spa-link class=\"footer-link\">🏠 ApexMobile Overview</a>\n            <a href=\"/#core-features\" data-spa-link class=\"footer-link\">§ Why Choose ApexMobile?</a><a href=\"/#install-guide\" data-spa-link class=\"footer-link\">§ Step-by-Step Installation Guide</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    \n        <hr style=\"border:none; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB; margin:32px 0 20px 0;\" />\n        <h2>More Daily News &amp; Updates</h2>\n        \n              <div class=\"news-item-block\">\n                <div class=\"news-meta-line\">\n                  <span class=\"news-category-tag\">Release Update</span>\n                  <span>November 4, 2026</span>\n                </div>\n                <a href=\"/news/apexmobile-v4-8-2-release-notes\" data-spa-link class=\"news-title-link\" style=\"font-size:16.5px;\">ApexMobile v4.8.2 Released with 45% Faster Cold-Start Engine</a>\n              </div>\n            \n              <div class=\"news-item-block\">\n                <div class=\"news-meta-line\">\n                  <span class=\"news-category-tag\">Infrastructure News</span>\n                  <span>October 21, 2026</span>\n                </div>\n                <a href=\"/news/global-edge-cdn-upgrade-low-latency-nodes\" data-spa-link class=\"news-title-link\" style=\"font-size:16.5px;\">Global Edge CDN Upgrade: 14 New Low-Latency Download Nodes Live</a>\n              </div>\n            \n      \n  ",
